; ======== DTC_Update_Status_MIL  (@0xd8a98) ========
        ; DTC_Update_Status_MIL(recordPtr, cfgPtr): updates record flags field[0xa] with drive-cycle fail bits
        ; (bit1/bit2 per lv_ast warm-up state), MIL/warning-lamp confirm bit (0x10), and the maturation/aging
        ; counter field[0xc]; when matured (==3) clears the pending-DTC bitmap and calls FUN_0db026.
        ; lv_conf_mis bit7 = MIL-enable config. Called by DTC_Update_Debounced/_Immediate on confirm.
